    "article_summary": "The article describes a photo-induced, oxidant-free oxidative C(sp2)-H/N-H cross-coupling between arenes (including methylarenes) and azoles. By using an acridinium photocatalyst and a cobalt co-catalyst, the reaction proceeds with hydrogen evolution rather than requiring sacrificial oxidants, maintaining high selectivity for aromatic C-H bonds over benzylic C-H bonds.",
